---
import {Image} from "astro:assets";
import Button from "./Button.astro";
import HomePageLink from "./HomePageLink.astro";
import headshot from "../assets/headshot.jpg";
import {site} from "@/lib/site";
---

<section
  class="mb-10 grid gap-6 md:mb-20 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] md:items-center md:gap-10 lg:gap-12"
>
  <div class="hero-fade-up">
    <div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-4">
      <Image
        src={headshot}
        alt=""
        class="h-20 w-20 shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-blue/50 object-cover object-[center_30%] md:hidden"
        width={2048}
        height={3072}
        loading="eager"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h1 class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-1 mb-2 md:mb-4">
          Hi, I'm Becca.
        </h1>
        <p
          class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-2 editorial-prose font-sans text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-text md:mb-4 md:text-xl"
        >
          I'm a software engineer, writer, and researcher. I write to help
          people in tech feel seen.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p
      class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 editorial-prose mb-6 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted"
    >
      I spent the last decade building software and leading the people who make
      it. Along the way, I started asking why some people's work turns into
      recognition and opportunity while someone else's disappears—and why so
      many problems at work feel intensely personal when they're actually
      remarkably common.
    </p>
    <p
      class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-4 editorial-prose mb-6 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted"
    >
      Now I use data, research, and the experiences of people in tech to figure
      out what's really going on.
    </p>
    <div
      class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-5 flex flex-col items-start gap-4"
    >
      <Button
        href={site.newsletterUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        {site.newsletterCta}
      </Button>
      <HomePageLink href="/writing">Read my writing</HomePageLink>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 relative hidden w-80 justify-self-end md:block lg:w-96"
  >
    <Image
      src={headshot}
      alt="Headshot of Becca Bailey"
      class="h-auto w-full rounded-lg border border-blue/50"
      width={2048}
      height={3072}
      loading="eager"
    />
  </div>
</section>
